  "sn48.31:1.1": "Pañcimāni bhikkhave indriyāni || ",
  "sn48.31:1.2": "katamani pañca || || ",
  "sn48.31:1.3": "Sukhindriyam dukkhindriyam somanassindriyaṃ domanassindriyam upekhindriyam || || 3. ",
  "sn48.31:1.4": "Imāni kho bhikkhave pañcindriyānī ",
  "sn48.31:1.5": "ti || || 2. "
